DTEND:20260810T012000Z
DTSTAMP:20260809T220000Z
UID:eqsomGsfZP
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 185 mins (3h05m)\n\nFilmed over 12 years with the sa
 me cast\, Richard Linklater’s Boyhood is a groundbreaking story of growi
 ng up as seen through the eyes of a child named Mason. This special 12th a
 nniversary screening includes a recorded Q&A with director Richard Linklat
 er and cast members Ethan Hawke\, Patricia Arquette\, and Ellar Coltrane.\
 n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/boyhood\n\nEstimated start: 15:
 15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
